==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|чета||troop, multitude, community}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*četa}}, akin to Czech {{m|cs|četa||platoon, squad}}, Serbo-Croatian {{m|sh|чета}}, Bulgarian {{m|bg|чета}},  possibly Latin {{m|la|caterva}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|чета́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-чета.ogg}}
* {{homophones|ru|Чита́}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|чета́}}

# [[couple]], [[pair]]
# [[match]]
#: {{uxi|ru|быть [[не]] '''чета́''' кому-л или чему-л|to not be in someone's league, to be inferior or superior in some respect}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|чета́}}
{{ru-noun-table|чета́|old=y}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|не чета́}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|чётный}}, {{l|ru|нечётный}}
* {{l|ru|сочета́ть|g=impf}}
** {{l|ru|сочета́ние|g=n}}

