* {{R:ru:Vasmer}}
* {{R:ru:Chernykh||386|2}}
* {{R:ru:Shansky}}
* {{R:ru:Tsyganenko||483}}
* {{R:ru:Shaposhnikov||524|2}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ru:Dal}}

